    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19822" root="سعر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْعُورٌ</span></b> : see its syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعِيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] (tropical:)  A man
<i>smitten by the</i> [<i>hot wind called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُوم</span>. (S, A.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And (tropical:)  <i>Vehemently hungry and thirsty:</i> (TA:)
<i>eager for food,</i> even though his belly be full;
(K;) and, it is said, <i>for drink</i> also. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَعِرٌ</span>.

